      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An approximately 24-hour cryogenic soak at ambient pressure is an applicable processing window.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed treatment applies to miniature components of approximately 30 × 30 × 20 mm3.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep cryogenic treatment will increase twin density in AlCrFeNiSi.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11355962::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep cryogenic treatment will induce lattice distortion in AlCrFeNiSi.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11355962::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep cryogenic treatment will refine the grain structure of additively manufactured AlCrFeNiSi.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deep cryogenic treatment will produce a more homogeneous phase distribution in AlCrFeNiSi.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12113129::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid and uniform thermal contraction during deep cryogenic treatment relieves internal residual stress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic thermal contraction triggers twin nucleation and microstructural refinement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11355962::page::002"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The induced microstructural changes stabilize the lattice and thereby enhance the strength–ductility balance.",
